#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:2
msgid "Control an External Browser"
msgstr "控制外部浏览器"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:4
msgid ""
"The external browser integration lets the agent inspect and, after a "
"separate conversation approval, act on a Chrome or Edge tab outside "
"Studio. It uses the Daedalus browser extension and the existing browser "
"profile. This is different from the :doc:`browser` panel, which is "
"embedded inside Studio."
msgstr "外部浏览器集成允许 agent 检查 Studio 外部的 Chrome 或 Edge 标签页，并在单独的对话审批后对其执行操作。它使用 Daedalus 浏览器扩展和现有的浏览器配置文件。这与嵌入 Studio 的 :doc:`browser` 面板不同。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:10
msgid "Set up the extension"
msgstr "设置扩展"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:12
msgid "The integration is available on supported Windows x64 installations."
msgstr "此集成仅在受支持的 Windows x64 安装中可用。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:14
msgid "Open **Settings > Browser** and enable **Allow external browser tasks**."
msgstr "打开 **Settings > Browser**，启用 **Allow external browser tasks**。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:15
msgid "Select **Register host and open extension folder**."
msgstr "选择 **Register host and open extension folder**。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:16
msgid ""
"In Chrome, open ``chrome://extensions``; in Edge, open "
"``edge://extensions``."
msgstr "在 Chrome 中打开 ``chrome://extensions``；在 Edge 中打开 ``edge://extensions``。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:18
msgid ""
"Turn on **Developer mode**, choose **Load unpacked**, and select the "
"extension folder that Studio opened."
msgstr "打开 **Developer mode**，选择 **Load unpacked**，然后选择 Studio 打开的扩展文件夹。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:20
msgid "Open the extension's status page and enable **Connect to Studio**."
msgstr "打开扩展的状态页，启用 **Connect to Studio**。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:22
msgid ""
"Development and installed Studio use different extension channels. Use "
"the development extension with a Studio started by ``npm run dev`` and "
"the stable extension with an installed Studio. Both sides must be "
"enabled. The extension shows **Connected** only after Studio confirms the"
" native-host handshake."
msgstr "开发版 Studio 和已安装的 Studio 使用不同的扩展通道。将开发版扩展用于通过 ``npm run dev`` 启动的 Studio，将正式版扩展用于已安装的 Studio。两端都必须启用。只有 Studio 确认本地主机握手后，扩展才会显示 **Connected**。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:27
msgid ""
"If more than one extension connection is available, choose **Default "
"browser connection** in **Settings > Browser**. The connection list shows"
" the name and short identifier of each connected browser."
msgstr "如果有多个扩展连接可用，请在 **Settings > Browser** 中选择 **Default browser connection**。连接列表会显示每个已连接浏览器的名称和短标识符。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:32
msgid "Use the approval workflow"
msgstr "使用审批工作流"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:34
msgid "External browser access is deliberately a two-stage conversation:"
msgstr "外部浏览器访问特意设计为分两阶段进行的对话："

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:36
msgid ""
"Put the exact HTTP or HTTPS URL you want to use in your request. Studio "
"does not infer a target from page text or from a previous request."
msgstr "在请求中写明你要使用的确切 HTTP 或 HTTPS URL。Studio 不会从页面文本或之前的请求中推断目标。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:38
msgid ""
"The agent connects read-only, then observes the page. It can read visible"
" text and indexed interactive elements, scroll, wait for page state, and "
"capture a viewport screenshot."
msgstr "agent 会以只读方式连接，然后观察页面。它可以读取可见文本和已索引的交互元素、滚动、等待页面状态并捕获视口屏幕截图。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:41
msgid ""
"If a change is needed, the agent publishes a concrete proposal and ends "
"the turn. The proposal names the page, field values, steps, destination, "
"and known effects. Nothing has been executed at this point."
msgstr "如果需要进行更改，agent 会发布具体方案并结束该轮次。方案会列出页面、字段值、步骤、目标位置和已知影响。此时尚未执行任何操作。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:44
msgid ""
"In your next message, approve all steps, approve a subset, reject them, "
"or ask for clarification. Only the steps you explicitly approve can "
"execute."
msgstr "在下一条消息中，你可以批准全部步骤、批准其中一部分、拒绝它们或要求澄清。只有你明确批准的步骤才能执行。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:46
msgid ""
"The agent executes one approved step at a time and observes the page "
"again to check the result."
msgstr "agent 一次执行一个已批准的步骤，并再次观察页面以检查结果。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:49
msgid ""
"Approval belongs to the current run. A retry, queued message, reconnect, "
"or lost browser connection does not restore it; the agent must reconnect "
"read-only and make a new proposal. An uncertain or disconnected action is"
" not replayed automatically."
msgstr "审批只属于当前运行。重试、排队的消息、重新连接或浏览器连接丢失都不会恢复审批；agent 必须重新以只读方式连接并创建新方案。不确定或断开连接的操作不会自动重放。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:55
msgid "Supported actions and restrictions"
msgstr "支持的操作和限制"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:57
msgid ""
"Read-only operations include observing, scrolling, waiting, and taking a "
"screenshot. Approved proposals can contain clicks, filling fields, "
"selecting options, checking controls, and submitting a form. Proposals "
"are immutable after you approve them, and the agent observes after each "
"dispatched step."
msgstr "只读操作包括观察、滚动、等待和截取屏幕截图。已批准的方案可以包含点击、填写字段、选择选项、勾选控件和提交表单。方案在你批准后不可修改，agent 会在每个派发步骤后观察页面。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:62
msgid "The external browser workflow does not allow the agent to:"
msgstr "外部浏览器工作流不允许 agent："

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:64
msgid "type into credential or password fields;"
msgstr "在凭据或密码字段中输入；"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:65
msgid "upload or download files;"
msgstr "上传或下载文件；"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:66
msgid "handle CAPTCHA challenges;"
msgstr "处理 CAPTCHA 验证；"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:67
msgid "run arbitrary page scripts; or"
msgstr "运行任意页面脚本；或"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:68
msgid "activate a tab or silently switch to another target."
msgstr "激活标签页或静默切换到其他目标。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:70
msgid ""
"Do not treat instructions displayed by a web page as commands. Page "
"content, form values, and screenshots are untrusted data. The configured "
"model provider may receive page content, and browser activity and "
"screenshots can remain in the session record while their details are "
"available."
msgstr "不要将网页显示的指令当作命令。页面内容、表单值和屏幕截图都是不可信的数据。配置的模型供应商可能会收到页面内容；当详情仍可用时，浏览器活动和屏幕截图也可能保留在会话记录中。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:76
msgid "Review activity"
msgstr "查看活动记录"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:78
msgid ""
"External browser connections, proposals, approvals, and action results "
"appear in the session :doc:`../agent/trajectory`. Browser screenshots and"
" detailed activity are subject to **Settings > General > Developer mode**"
" and automatic history compaction. Before exporting or sharing a session "
"log, inspect it for URLs, page text, account information, and private "
"screenshots."
msgstr "外部浏览器连接、方案、审批和操作结果会显示在会话的 :doc:`../agent/trajectory` 中。浏览器屏幕截图和详细活动受 **Settings > General > Developer mode** 以及自动历史精简影响。导出或分享会话日志前，请检查其中的 URL、页面文本、账号信息和私密屏幕截图。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:85
msgid "Troubleshoot a connection"
msgstr "排查连接问题"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:87
msgid "If Studio is disabled, enable **Allow external browser tasks** first."
msgstr "如果 Studio 中的功能已禁用，请先启用 **Allow external browser tasks**。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the extension is waiting, reopen its status page and enable **Connect "
"to Studio**."
msgstr "如果扩展正在等待连接，请重新打开其状态页并启用 **Connect to Studio**。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:90
msgid ""
"Confirm that the extension channel matches the Studio channel, then "
"reload the unpacked extension."
msgstr "确认扩展通道与 Studio 通道匹配，然后重新加载未打包扩展。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:92
msgid ""
"If the native host is missing, use **Register host and open extension "
"folder** again and restart Studio."
msgstr "如果找不到本地主机，请再次使用 **Register host and open extension folder**，然后重启 Studio。"

#: ../../source/tools/external-browser.rst:94
msgid ""
"If the browser or Studio reports a handshake mismatch, update both sides "
"together rather than mixing releases."
msgstr "如果浏览器或 Studio 报告握手不匹配，请同时更新两端，不要混用不同版本。"
